WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.678
Independence is not a slogan here.

2
00:00:02.628 --> 00:00:04.724
It is built into who has authority.

3
00:00:04.724 --> 00:00:11.704
Commercial teams cannot change technical findings, and an independent reviewer can stop a statement from being issued.

4
00:00:11.704 --> 00:00:16.365
Fees are fixed and published, never tied to a favourable result.

5
00:00:16.365 --> 00:00:21.938
Related-party work is clearly disclosed and kept out of independent validation counts.

6
00:00:21.938 --> 00:00:25.935
Clients can challenge a finding through a defined appeal process.

7
00:00:25.935 --> 00:00:32.485
Working papers, sampling evidence and technical reviews are retained for at least seven years.

8
00:00:32.485 --> 00:00:39.230
The aim is simple: every decision must remain explainable, challengeable and supported by evidence.
